{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/trinity-continuum-\u00e6on/1397875-psionic-powers-and-scale","id":1397875,"title":"Psionic Powers and Scale","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Onyx Path Worlds","The Trinity Continuum","Trinity Continuum: \u00c6on"],"posts":[{"date":"2020-06-20T19:19:02-07:00","id":1397875,"title":"Psionic Powers and Scale","content":"<b>Psions and Scale</b><br /> Psions are capable of some limited scale increase in their deeds, as long they can already do things beyond human capacities.<br /> Several powers, particularly the powers dealing with speed and some times size, already grant access to a certain degree of scale, and those powers are not affected by this set of rules.<br /> <br /> <b>The 6-dot Powers and Stacking Scale</b><br /> Any scale gained thru the methods described bellow can stack with the gain of scale granted by the 6 dots powers. This is also the only way to grant scale higher than described below in Attributes, Durability and Power using psionic powers. Not even multiple powers combined can increase scale above the value listed, except for the use of the 6-dot powers.<br /> <br /> <b>Attributes</b><br /> While it\u2019s possible to increase attributes beyond 5 dots thru several powers, its not properly a gain of scale, and so, it\u2019s not possible to match the gain of scale of an Aberrant, for example. To counter it, a Psion can spend part of the additional successes to gain proper scale above a regular human, on a very limited way.<br /> The powers Perfection (Psychomorphing 5), Enhancement (Electromanipulation 3), Stoicism (Augendis 2), Direction (Augendis 3) and Precision (Augendis 4) can no longer increase one attribute above 5 dots, but can be used to grant scale 2 to that attribute, at cost of 8 successes.<br /> Overcharge (Vitakinesis 7) grants Scale 2 on the attributes of the chosen approach, and can increase any attribute to a maximum of 5 dots, including the ones that had scale increased.<br /> <br /> <b>Durability</b><br /> Psions have some powers that can be used to resist damage, and those are the ones that need most scale to resist the attacks of Aberrants.<br /> Kinetic Shield (Perikinesis 1) and Energy Shield (Perikinesis 2) gain the following advantage according to the Mode dots instead of mode dots as Soft Armor, that can be further increased by the 6dot power of the mode:<br /> \u2022 Durability Scale 1 and Soft 1<br /> \u2022\u2022 Durability Scale 1 and Soft 2<br /> \u2022\u2022\u2022 Durability Scale 1 and Soft 3<br /> \u2022\u2022\u2022\u2022 Durability Scale 2 and Soft 1<br /> \u2022\u2022\u2022\u2022\u2022 Durability Scale 2 and Soft 2<br /> \u2022\u2022\u2022\u2022\u2022 \u2022 Durability Scale 2 and Soft 3<br /> \u2022\u2022\u2022\u2022\u2022 \u2022\u2022 Durability Scale 3 and Soft 1<br /> Chimera (Transmogrify 4), Sheath (Thermokinesis 3) and Reinforce (Augendis 1) armors can\u2019t have more than Soft 3 tag, instead they gain access to the following tags that can be added once.<br /> Armor Tag<br /> Durability Scale 2 (3): The power grants scale 2 against any kind of damage it is effective.<br /> Durability Scale 3 (6): The power grants scale 3 against any kind of damage it is effective.<br /> <br /> <b>Power</b><br /> Psions have multiple powers that can be used to cause damage, and those are the ones that need most scale to go thru Aberrants\u2019 armors.<br /> Photonic Power (Photokinesis 3), Flash (Thermokinesis 2), Velocity (Telekinesis 2) gain the following advantage according to the Mode dots instead of mode dots as Enhancement, that can be further increased by the 6dot power of the mode:<br /> \u2022 Power Scale 1 and Enhancement 1<br /> \u2022\u2022 Power Scale 1 and Enhancement 2<br /> \u2022\u2022\u2022 Power Scale 1 and Enhancement 3<br /> \u2022\u2022\u2022\u2022 Power Scale 2 and Enhancement 1<br /> \u2022\u2022\u2022\u2022\u2022 Power Scale 2 and Enhancement 2<br /> \u2022\u2022\u2022\u2022\u2022 \u2022 Power Scale 2 and Enhancement 3<br /> \u2022\u2022\u2022\u2022\u2022 \u2022\u2022 Power Scale 3 and Enhancement 1<br /> Enhancement (Electromanipulation 3) and Assault (Algesis 2) gain the following advantage according to the Mode dots instead of Mod dots/2 Enhancement, that can be further increased by the 6dot power of the mode:<br /> \u2022 or \u2022\u2022 Power Scale 1 and Enhancement 1<br /> \u2022\u2022\u2022 or \u2022\u2022\u2022\u2022 Power Scale 1 and Enhancement 2<br /> \u2022\u2022\u2022\u2022\u2022 or \u2022\u2022\u2022\u2022\u2022 \u2022 Power Scale 1 and Enhancement 3<br /> \u2022\u2022\u2022\u2022\u2022 \u2022\u2022 Power Scale 2 and Enhancement 1<br /> Chimera (Transmogrify 4) weapons can\u2019t have more than a flat enhancement of 3, instead they gain access to the following tags that can be added once.<br /> Weapon Tag<br /> Power Scale 2 (3): The attack has scale 2, with no side effects.<br /> Power Scale 3 (6): The attack has scale 3, with no side effects.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481584/house-rules-bundle-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">House Rules - The Bundle</a> - House Rules for Everyone<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481581/powered-inspiration-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">Powered Inspired</a> - Powered Characters using Inspiration and Gifts<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/413362/Fists-and-Tomes-BUNDLE\" target=\"_blank\">Fists and Tomes</a> - Inspired Martial Arts and Mysticism for Talents<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/492147/supertech\" target=\"_blank\">Supertech</a> - Super Science in the hands of Talents","edited":{"userid":24985,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24985-mateus-luz","user":"Mateus Luz","date":". 06-21-2020, 06:48 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24985-mateus-luz","name":"Mateus Luz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24985_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2950"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-06-20T19:25:50-07:00","id":1397876,"title":"","content":"I made it with a simple idea, not going beyond 3 in any Enhancement or Soft Armor.<br /> My reference was 1 scale = 3 enhancements, because it can be pretty powerful. Even if limited to granting 2 enhancements, scale can be used to be overwhelmeing against weaklings (including multiple injuries with a single attack) and because it can be used to fight larger and more powerful adversaries.<br /> in the end the power in the hand of a proxy level character is pretty strong, but yet \u201ckind of\u201d the same level as before.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481584/house-rules-bundle-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">House Rules - The Bundle</a> - House Rules for Everyone<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481581/powered-inspiration-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">Powered Inspired</a> - Powered Characters using Inspiration and Gifts<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/413362/Fists-and-Tomes-BUNDLE\" target=\"_blank\">Fists and Tomes</a> - Inspired Martial Arts and Mysticism for Talents<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/492147/supertech\" target=\"_blank\">Supertech</a> - Super Science in the hands of Talents","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24985-mateus-luz","name":"Mateus Luz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24985_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2950"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-06-21T15:38:10-07:0